<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<PathAssistant xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
        DEACTIVATED 2026-08-09, NOT DELETED, AND THAT IS DELIBERATE.

        NDA__c gained two record types in this tranche (Acquisition_NDA, Disposition_NDA). A
        Path is configured PER RECORD TYPE, and recordTypeName CANNOT BE RE-POINTED on an
        existing PathAssistant - so this __MASTER__ path is superseded by two new files,
        NDA_Path_Acquisition and NDA_Path_Disposition, exactly as Tranche 2 superseded
        Disposition_Path with Disposition_Path_On_Market / _Off_Market.

        It is retained rather than deleted because it is the record of the guidance text the
        acquisition steps were copied from. NDA_Path_Acquisition carries the Pending, Sent and
        Signed <info> text and <fieldNames> BYTE-IDENTICAL to the three steps below; the only
        addition there is a new Received step between Sent and Signed.

        Once record types exist, a __MASTER__ path renders for the Master type only - which
        after the row migration is NO ROWS. Leaving it active would therefore do nothing useful
        and would make the Path configuration ambiguous to the next reader.

        ORDER OF OPERATIONS AT DEPLOY: profile record-type assignment and the row migration off
        Master must both complete BEFORE the two new paths are relied on, for the same reason
        Tranche 2's gate A2 exists - a row still on Master matches no record-type Path and
        renders a Path with no current position.
    -->
    <active>false</active>
    <entityName>NDA__c</entityName>
    <fieldName>Status__c</fieldName>
    <masterLabel>NDA Path</masterLabel>
    <pathAssistantSteps>
        <fieldNames>Counterparty_Name__c</fieldNames>
        <fieldNames>Method__c</fieldNames>
        <info>NDA opened for the deal. Confirm the counterparty and how it will be sent, then send it out.</info>
        <picklistValueName>Pending</picklistValueName>
    </pathAssistantSteps>
    <pathAssistantSteps>
        <fieldNames>Date_Sent__c</fieldNames>
        <fieldNames>OneDrive_URL__c</fieldNames>
        <info>NDA sent to the counterparty. Track the days out and follow up until it comes back signed.</info>
        <picklistValueName>Sent</picklistValueName>
    </pathAssistantSteps>
    <pathAssistantSteps>
        <fieldNames>Date_Signed__c</fieldNames>
        <fieldNames>NDA_Signed__c</fieldNames>
        <info>NDA fully executed. NDA Signed = TRUE is what unlocks advancing the deal to Underwriting.</info>
        <picklistValueName>Signed</picklistValueName>
    </pathAssistantSteps>
    <recordTypeName>__MASTER__</recordTypeName>
</PathAssistant>
